<title>USA: Texaco employees opt for settlement - lawyer.</title>
<headline>Texaco employees opt for settlement - lawyer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texaco Inc's agreement to settle a racial discrimination suit for $176.1 million has passed another hurdle on the road to final approval with no potential claimants asking to opt out of the accord, a plaintiff's lawyer said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The proposed settlement, which was reached in November, still requires court approval. A fairness hearing on the accord is set for March 18.</p>
</text>
